sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Admin
  participant UI as Panel UI
  participant P as Panel
  participant A as Agent container (new server)

  Admin->>UI: Connect a server<br/>(name, roles)
  UI->>P: create enrollment token<br/>(hashed, single use, 15 min)
  P-->>UI: docker run command<br/>with token and CA pin
  Admin->>A: docker run
  A->>A: generate key pair<br/>and CSR
  A->>P: Enroll(token, CSR) over TLS,<br/>panel verified with CA pin
  P->>P: validate token, create host,<br/>sign client certificate
  P-->>A: certificate and CA chain
  A->>P: SubscribeCommands over mTLS
  A->>P: ReportInventory
  P-->>UI: realtime: host online
